  <ProtossMech.GunSmithEditor.ScoreHelp>Estimated scores on a fixed scale shared by all platforms; white marker = {0}.\nFirepower: damage × burst count / (aim time + burst duration + cooldown). 30 damage/s = 50.\nAccuracy: mean vanilla hit chance; CE averages spread and sway scores, each 1 = 50.\nMobility: 5 kg = 50, adjusted by movement offset against a reference of 4.6 cells/s.\nHandling: aim time + half cooldown; 1.5 s = 50.\nExcept vanilla accuracy, reference values use a diminishing-returns curve. Scores do not model target armour, pawn skills, reloads or special projectile effects. See Details for actual weapon attributes.</ProtossMech.GunSmithEditor.ScoreHelp>
